<view class="page">
  <view class="privacy-intro">新用户默认所有资料均不公开。头像、联系人和关系只保存在本机。</view>
  <view class="card consent-card">
    <view class="consent-row" bindtap="openPublication"><view><text>资料公开范围</text><text class="consent-sub">{{profile ? publication.title : (loading ? '读取中…' : '状态暂不可用')}} · 在“导入码与公开资料”中管理</text></view><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading && !profile}}">正在加载隐私设置</view>
  <view class="app-state app-state--error" wx:if="{{loadError}}">{{loadError}}<button class="app-action" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">重新加载</button></view>
  <view class="section-title">协议与授权</view>
  <view class="card consent-card">
    <view class="consent-row" bindtap="openTerms"><text>用户协议</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
    <view class="consent-row" bindtap="openPolicy"><text>隐私政策</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
    <view class="consent-row" bindtap="openWechatGuide"><text>小程序隐私保护指引</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
    <view class="consent-row">
      <view><text>AI 智能整理授权</text><text class="consent-sub">{{aiConsent ? '已同意向 DeepSeek 发送粘贴的文字' : '未授权，使用时会单独询问'}}</text></view>
      <button wx:if="{{aiConsent}}" class="consent-button" size="mini" bindtap="withdrawAi">撤回</button>
    </view>
    <view class="consent-row danger" bindtap="withdrawAll"><text>撤回全部同意并退出登录</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card withdrawal-panel" wx:if="{{withdrawalOptions}}"><view class="section-title">撤回前，确认公开资料</view><view class="app-help">撤回同意会退出登录，但不会自动撤下已公开的资料。可先前往公开设置关闭昵称公开；也可保留公开资料并继续撤回。本机联系人不会删除。</view><button class="ui-secondary" bindtap="openPublication">先管理公开资料</button><button class="danger-button" bindtap="confirmWithdrawAll">继续撤回并退出</button><button class="ui-link" bindtap="cancelWithdrawal">取消</button></view>
</view>
